---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Container from '../components/Container.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Learn more about Digital Divide and our mission to explore the intersection of technology and humanity."
>
  <section class="py-12 sm:py-16">
    <Container narrow>
      <header class="mb-12">
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold sm:text-4xl">About</h1>
      </header>

      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          Digital Divide is an independent publication exploring how technology
          shapes our lives, relationships, and sense of self.
        </p>

        <h2>Our Mission</h2>
        <p>
          In an age of hot takes and engagement bait, we believe there's still
          a place for thoughtful, long-form writing. Our essays aim to go beyond
          the surface—to examine not just what's happening in technology, but
          why it matters for how we live.
        </p>

        <p>
          We're not interested in reviewing the latest gadgets or breathlessly
          covering funding rounds. Instead, we explore the deeper currents: the
          attention economy, digital citizenship, the aesthetics of the internet,
          and the human cost of automation.
        </p>

        <h2>What We Cover</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Technology & Society</strong> — How digital tools reshape
            communities, institutions, and democracy
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Attention & Time</strong> — The economics of our most
            precious cognitive resource
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Work & Identity</strong> — What automation means for how
            we find meaning and purpose
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Digital Culture</strong> — The aesthetics, memes, and
            movements that define life online
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Who We Are</h2>
        <p>
          Digital Divide is written and edited by a small team of writers,
          researchers, and technologists who believe that nuance is not a
          weakness but a strength.
        </p>

        <p>
          We're independent and reader-supported. We don't run ads or sell your
          data. If you find value in our work, consider
          <a href="/subscribe">subscribing to our newsletter</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>Get in Touch</h2>
        <p>
          Have a story idea, feedback, or just want to say hello? We'd love to
          hear from you. Reach out at
          <a href="mailto:hello@digitaldivide.com">hello@digitaldivide.com</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </Container>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
